This commit adds a project that demonstrates an n8n automation for scaling content creation, which grew a website to 200k annual sessions.

The workflow automates the generation of SEO-optimized "roundup" articles by:
- Fetching context from an internal API.
- Building a detailed prompt for an AI "Deep Research" tool.
- Using a human-in-the-loop step for quality control and pasting research results.
- Generating the article modularly (intro, body, conclusion) for better output.
- Pushing the final content to a headless CMS (Sanity.io) via a custom endpoint.
